00:51:06.410 --> 00:51:08.480
Or again, if you've got an image

00:51:08.480 --> 00:51:10.720
that you're comfortable with
and it's not distracting,

00:51:10.720 --> 00:51:14.140
and I think that's kind of
the guiding principle there,

00:51:14.140 --> 00:51:17.120
is it distracting and
drawing the attention away

00:51:17.120 --> 00:51:20.970
from the viewer that you don't wanna do.

